      "title": "Distribution feeder load shapes, participating utility set",
      "summary": "Hourly feeder-level load shapes contributed by participating utilities under a data-sharing agreement.",
      "description": "Hourly load at feeder granularity for participating distribution utilities. Feeder-level load is treated as commercially and operationally sensitive by every contributor, and several will not participate if the existence of their contribution is discoverable. So this record's existence is itself allow-listed: a caller who is not on the list is told the dataset does not exist, which is the only answer that does not confirm it does.",
